{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"54740d4747ef2823ec94bd355c62b72ffeb1fda1d4664a98f153939a2e44e579","ja":"みなさん、私たちのコンテンポラリーダンス……\nいかがだったでしょうか？","zh":"大家，我们的现代舞……\n觉得怎么样呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"641b512da5c00639f3904685bfd0737efc31238de68d17c7fae67fda12165f86","ja":"コンテンポラリーダンスって、どういうものを\nそう名付けるのか、はっきりしていないそうです。","zh":"据说，当代舞究竟指什么样的东西，\n似乎并不明确。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"98c9e34dbe0d195137a7fa75b16e7afdcde499642238d5bd40553b08bfcea132","ja":"だからとても難しくて……でも、その分どうすれば\nいいか、ワクワクしながら考えています。","zh":"所以非常难……不过，正因为如此，该怎么做\n才好呢，我正兴奋地思考着。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5aa919e274319c146a95b15e85b3298b6c8954b3a1d706649e352b530102e6f0","ja":"みなさんにも、そんなわたし達のコンテンポラリー\nダンスを、感じてもらえていたらうれしいです♪","zh":"也请大家感受一下我们那样的现代舞，\n如果能感受到我会很开心♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b7bf4b4e939ed5874891f9831f182bf59ac37563b4520fdae59545a8ec41d6f0","ja":"それに、今ので完成じゃなくて、私たちのダンスは、\nもっともーっと進化する予定です！","zh":"而且，现在这个还不算完成，我们的舞蹈，\n预定还要更——加进化！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"134a7ac7a5c43b2ac8b60a1aa307b36a08734e6294c9dcc9af45787df8b73db8","ja":"よかったら、進化した私たちに会いに\n劇場にきてください！","zh":"如果愿意的话，欢迎来剧场\n见见进化后的我们！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3b50539b596b27700bd32c2d322e67c48b47a71409420c5c22e78201c01d9f2f","ja":"ロコ達のクールでスペシャルなパフォーマンスを\nお披露目します♪","zh":"ROCO们酷炫又特别的表演\n献上♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_964.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"85805111205aabb0b74d27eb5370805beceed4de2049ce253c8aadc261bd40cc","ja":"それでは、また……\nベリーベリーサンクスです！","zh":"那么，下次见……\n非常感谢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
